# GEMINI_API_KEY: Required for Gemini AI API calls — this is what lets Saphira think.
# AI Studio automatically injects this at runtime from user secrets when the app
# runs inside AI Studio. Users configure this via the Secrets panel in the AI Studio UI.
#
# To run the app yourself (Android Studio / a real phone build):
#   1. Copy this file and name the copy ".env" (the .env file is git-ignored — never commit it).
#   2. Replace MY_GEMINI_API_KEY below with a real key from Google AI Studio
#      (aistudio.google.com → "Get API key").
# If the key is left as the placeholder below, the app still runs, but Saphira
# will show "Saphira needs her key to wake up" instead of answering.
GEMINI_API_KEY=MY_GEMINI_API_KEY
